Hi,

I merged the patch from AudioScience for snd-asihpi driver into the
CVS tree.  To build this driver, you need to install HPK module
beforehand, and pass --with-asihpk module option to specify the HPK
source code tree.  Otherwise the driver won't be built.

I fixed the driver for the recent changes of ALSA, but of course
untested :)


Takashi


